data/property-financials-status.json
data/property-financials-status.json.*.tmp
# data/ar-mapping-cache.json is TRACKED, not ignored (mapping-cache.ts header, corrected
# 2026-08-24 / PR #302: a durable human SKIP ruling belongs in version control). The ignore rule
# that sat here 2026-08-17..2026-09-22 was inert against an already-tracked file but would have
# silently un-tracked it after any `git rm --cached` / delete-and-recreate, and the refute gate
# (scripts/check-refute-required.ts) now names the file as financial data. No rule on purpose.
# Baked confidential mirror data — regenerated by `npm run bake`, never committed
public/snapshot.json
public/macro.json
